title = "The Rebellions"

[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
<h2>The Rebellions (version 1.1)</h2>
<i>Your followers are tired of the ruthless rule of the Fortress of Valdras. Together with your rebel allies you must conquer Valdras, and all that lies beyond it.</i>
<p>
This is my first attempt at a Netstorm Scenario. Have fun with it! I'm working on a sequel for it called The Return of Aridan.
<br>
Send all feedback to: jcipparone@hotmail.com.

